1
00:00:02,420 --> 00:00:04,420
After graduating from high school,

2
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:07,217
Leone Abbacchio immediately
followed his deep sense

3
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:10,418
of justice directly into a
job with the police force.

4
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:14,577
But the realization of his
dream did little to quell the

5
00:00:14,660 --> 00:00:18,366
unease he felt from the contradictions
plaguing his daily work.

6
00:00:18,860 --> 00:00:22,697
The people he was expected to
defend each day were the very ones

7
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:26,137
causing trouble around the city he
risked his life to serve and protect.

8
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:30,749
These ne 'er-do-wells seemed to revel
in destroying law enforcement property,

9
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:35,254
stealing from the public, and committing
other heinous acts of depravity.

10
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:49,400
It was a thankless job, and the demands
never seemed to stop, nor did the insults or

11
00:00:50,380 --> 00:00:51,397
verbal humiliations.

12
00:00:51,480 --> 00:00:56,068
He imperiled his life again and again
to put the dregs of society behind bars,

13
00:00:56,760 --> 00:01:02,020
But this was a city where money talked,
and criminals, more often than not, walked.

14
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:05,220
Quit stirring up trouble. Sorry.

15
00:01:05,440 --> 00:01:06,557
It don't matter now.

16
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:10,300
The contradictions became one
of Abakio's greatest teachers.

17
00:01:13,720 --> 00:01:15,460
Ah, come on, officer.

18
00:01:15,760 --> 00:01:16,819
