the beginning of the end for Abakio.

49
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:27,360
He was labeled a dirty cop
and punished accordingly.

50
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:29,200
What was worse,

51
00:03:29,480 --> 00:03:31,997
