324
00:22:19,760 --> 00:22:25,480
What must I say, what must I do?

325
00:22:26,760 --> 00:22:33,097
To show how much I'm gonna freak you.

326
00:22:33,180 --> 00:22:39,717
What must I say, what must I do?

327
00:22:39,800 --> 00:22:45,260
To show how much I'm gonna freak you?

328
